ap=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=huyZUCEUNBQQ7kNvwEke6Ab&_nc_oc=AdqWbSGj8YMFNk2ov_IdBJwpbaJ5cZkom6_Ugyzmu8NO_-0ZEUU5VvtdnAF1869glpk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQToGxuU22frtwLMEHbo2l3Lor7PO31Rmwjk0sMT2ajCfw&oe=6B005BAD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1167682141747027", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294643_1167682145080360_2543075048495261262_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C3VAkg0IqKsQ7kNvwHarzLk&_nc_oc=AdoATizj7AmvawPafDpRiHEuRkvZUYw4Szc9W_0A_w1wfCTW_9yY5CEbuo-kfB3ZWgw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQXTvBGb6OEYCv-9sQOYMhiP1ueHpHVJ1FE1s-IQoHTdA&oe=6B005AB0"}, "display_name": "Seagull Simulator", "keywords": ["bird", "beach", "casual", "seagull", "simulator"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Seagull Simulator, where the beach is your playground and chaos is your superpower.\n\nThis fast, funny VR sandbox throws you straight into outrageous missions packed with unpredictable moments.\n{1806714260006199}\n**Soar around the island and discover its secrets**\n{850433324714902}\n**Create your own seaside mayhem**\n\nCause a scene, complete missions your way, or ignore the rules entirely.\n{1920300625253948}\n**Turn small pranks into full-blown beach disasters**\n\nArm yourself with absurd weapons and experiment with physics-driven interactions. \n{1254649560141516}\n\n\n\n**Spread your wings. Start the chaos. Do what Birds do best. Poop.**\n\n\n\n{1606896797172804}", "short_description": "Rule the beach in Seagull Simulator, a chaotic VR sandbox adventure. Fly, explore a coastal town, complete wild challenges, and unleash hilarious mayhem. Steal snacks, squawk at unsuspecting tourists, and cause nonstop comedy chaos. Play now and cause problems on purpose!"}]}, "developer_name": "VRMonkey", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://vrmonkey.c